OL,3,GNEWSATrade body urges more HGV stops
OL,4,Aafter driver fined
OL,5,
OL,6,FA trade association has renewed calls
OL,7,Ffor better facilities for HGV drivers
OL,8,Fafter one was fined for parking in the
OL,9,Fmiddle of a road and falling asleep.
OL,11,FSuffolk Police said on Monday it found
OL,12,Fthe lorry stopped on road markings on
OL,13,FWalton Avenue in Felixstowe with the
OL,14,Fdriver asleep in the cab, which it said
OL,15,Fposed "a road safety risk".
OL,17,FThe Road Haulage Association (RHA) said
OL,18,Fthe incident highlighted a long-running
OL,19,Flack of suitable parking facilities.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
